{"kind":"propose","text":"Adopt the P0 comprehension guard from diagnosis #12706: expose the exact merge preflight as a read-only structured CLI and MCP merge plan, implemented by extracting and reusing the same validation and succession logic as merge. The plan must report the exact reviewed scope, changed paths, classified live artifacts, proposed retirements and successors, and exact allow/refuse reasons; it must have no durable or repository mutation. Add regression coverage for the architecture case: a reviewed candidate at one path authorizes same-path retirement of another author's in-main predecessor, while that predecessor is not a review input."}